22
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:11,200
I love filming in public it's my favorite activity ever ever ever ever and I love gaslighting myself into thinking I like it.
我爱在公共场合拍摄，最喜欢了，真的真的。还喜欢反复说服自己，我就是喜欢这么做。

23
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:17,760
I am a little disappointed in myself though cuz I did stray away from my list a teeny bit okay a little bit.
